There is **no `pyproject.toml` or `setup.py`** at the project root (`/home/silimon/mcp-auto/`) or in the MCP-Auto-Server directory. This is a Node.js/TypeScript project with Python as a secondary component (the Python files are helper scripts copied into `dist/` during the build). Python dependencies are managed solely via `requirements.txt`.

